.TH BBTOP 1
.SH NAME
bbtop \- lightweight process resource analyzer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B bbtop
[\-\-snapshot] [\-\-sort cpu|mem|pid] [\-\-tree] [\-\-interval SEC] [\-\-limit N]
.SH DESCRIPTION
bbtop reads process information from procfs and reports process resource usage.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-help
Show help text.
.SH EXAMPLES
.B bbtop \-\-snapshot \-\-sort cpu
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 on success, non-zero on error.
